<title>PHILIPPINES: La Tondena sets 20 centavos cash dividend.</title>
<headline>La Tondena sets 20 centavos cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Tondena Distillers Inc said on Friday its board had approved a 20 centavos cash dividend to shareholders on record April 11.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, La Tondena said the dividend will be paid to shareholders April 30.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
